E006_binary_type_mismatch.cmm:3:16: semantic error: operator '+' cannot be applied to int and string
  |
3 |     let x = 10 + "hello";
  |                ^
what went wrong:
  The '+' operator cannot combine values of type int and string.
how to fix:
  Make sure both sides have matching compatible types. C-- never converts
  types automatically.
